# Shopping.io Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Shopping.io.

Shopping.io is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token, staking, exchange and club smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Shopping.io  
Audit type: Token, staking, exchange and club smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

