## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work across token, staking, exchange and membership related contract systems.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to token infrastructure, staking contracts, exchange logic and consumer Web3 commerce systems.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
